{
  "info": {
    "name": "FixDesk Phase 1-2 (Laravel)",
    "description": "ทดสอบ auth + repair flow (Phase 1) และ user/technician/location management (Phase 2) ของ backend Laravel ตัวใหม่. รัน request ตามลำดับในแต่ละ folder แล้ว token/rf_code/id ต่างๆ จะถูกเก็บลง collection variable ให้อัตโนมัติ ไม่ต้อง copy-paste เอง",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8000/api" },
    { "key": "admin_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "tech_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "rf_code", "value": "" },
    { "key": "uploaded_filename", "value": "" },
    { "key": "new_user_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "new_tt_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "new_bd_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "new_fl_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "new_room_id", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health Check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "{{base_url}}/health"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_token', data.token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userName\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin1234\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Technician)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('tech_token', data.token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userName\": \"tech01\",\n  \"password\": \"tech1234\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/login"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Repair (Public)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Repair (JSON, no files)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.rf_code) { pm.collectionVariables.set('rf_code', data.rf_code); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"us_id\": 1,\n  \"repair_type_id\": 1,\n  \"room_id\": 1,\n  \"problem_detail\": \"แอร์ห้อง 101 เสีย\",\n  \"issue_description\": \"เปิดไม่ติด มีเสียงดัง\",\n  \"phone_number\": \"0800000000\",\n  \"urgency\": \"high\",\n  \"skip_line_notification\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/repair-requests",
            "description": "ไม่ต้อง login ก็สร้างได้ (endpoint นี้ไม่มี auth middleware เหมือนต้นฉบับ) — ตั้ง skip_line_notification เป็น true เพื่อไม่ต้องพึ่ง LINE credentials ตอนทดสอบ"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Repair (with file attachment)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.rf_code) { pm.collectionVariables.set('rf_code', data.rf_code); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "us_id", "value": "1", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "repair_type_id", "value": "1", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "room_id", "value": "1", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "problem_detail", "value": "แอร์ห้อง 101 เสีย", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "issue_description", "value": "เปิดไม่ติด มีเสียงดัง", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "phone_number", "value": "0800000000", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "urgency", "value": "high", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "skip_line_notification", "value": "true", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "files[]", "type": "file", "src": [] }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/repair-requests-with-files",
            "description": "⚠️ ก่อนกด Send ต้องคลิกที่ช่อง 'Select files' ตรงแถว files[] แล้วเลือกไฟล์รูป/วิดีโอจากเครื่องก่อนเสมอ ถ้าไม่เลือกไฟล์จะเจอ error 'EISDIR' (ห้ามใส่ชื่อ field เป็น 'files' เฉยๆ ไม่งั้น PHP จะเก็บได้แค่ไฟล์สุดท้ายถ้าแนบหลายไฟล์)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Repair (JSON)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"us_id\": 1,\n  \"repair_type_id\": 1,\n  \"room_id\": 1,\n  \"problem_detail\": \"แอร์ห้อง 101 เสีย (แก้ไขรายละเอียด)\",\n  \"issue_description\": \"เปิดไม่ติดเลย\",\n  \"urgency\": \"medium\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/repair-requests/{{rf_code}}",
            "description": "แก้ไขได้เฉพาะใบที่ยังสถานะ pending เท่านั้น (ตรงกับต้นฉบับ) — us_id ต้องส่งมาด้วยเสมอ ไม่งั้น DB จะปฏิเสธ (คอลัมน์ rf_us_id ห้ามเป็น NULL)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Repair Detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/repair-requests/{{rf_code}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User Repairs (user_id=1)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/my-repairs/1"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Repair Stats (user_id=1)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/repair-stats/1"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload Files (standalone)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.files && data.files[0]) { pm.collectionVariables.set('uploaded_filename', data.files[0].filename); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "files[]", "type": "file", "src": [] }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/upload-repair-files",
            "description": "⚠️ ก่อนกด Send ต้องคลิกที่ช่อง 'Select files' ตรงแถว files[] แล้วเลือกไฟล์รูป/วิดีโอจากเครื่องก่อนเสมอ ถ้าไม่เลือกไฟล์จะเจอ error 'EISDIR'. ใช้ตอนต้องการอัปโหลดไฟล์ล่วงหน้าแล้วค่อยส่ง path แนบไปตอนสร้าง/แก้ใบแจ้งซ่อมแบบ JSON"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete File",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/delete-file/{{uploaded_filename}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Repair (Admin/Technician - ต้อง login ก่อน)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Admin Repairs (all)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/repairs"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Assign Individual (tech01 -> rf_code)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"rf_code\": \"{{rf_code}}\",\n  \"technician_id\": 2,\n  \"is_lead\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/assign-repair"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Assign Team",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"rf_code\": \"{{rf_code}}\",\n  \"technician_ids\": [2],\n  \"lead_id\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/assign-repair-team"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept Job (as Technician)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tech_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/technician/accept-job/{{rf_code}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Technician Repairs (as tech01)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tech_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/technician/repairs"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Repair",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/my-repairs/{{rf_code}}",
            "description": "ลบได้เฉพาะใบที่ยังสถานะ pending เท่านั้น — ถ้าเพิ่งทดสอบ Assign/Accept Job ไปแล้ว rf_code ปัจจุบันจะไม่ใช่ pending แล้ว ให้กลับไปกด 'Create Repair (JSON, no files)' ใหม่อีกรอบก่อน (จะได้ rf_code ใบใหม่ที่ยัง pending) แล้วค่อยมาลบ"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. User Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Titles",
          "request": {
